  "referenceNumber": "RUS1555",
  "remarks": "\nNikolai BULAEV is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 as BULAEV is 1. The Deputy Chairman of the Central Election Commission (CEC) of the Russian Federation, and therefore a head or deputy head of a public body or agency of the Government of the Russian Federation; and 2. Through his role with the CEC, has repeatedly supported policies and engaged in actions which have destabilised Ukraine or undermined or threatened the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
